OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies in crash with parked
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has died after his car
OL,7,Fcollided with a parked car and damaged
OL,8,Fseveral other vehicles nearby, said
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FKingsland, at the junction of Tendring
OL,13,FRoad, in Harlow, shortly after 05:30
OL,14,FGMT.
OL,16,FThe driver, who was the only person in
OL,17,Fthe car, died at the scene, said Essex
OL,18,FPolice. The road was closed for several
OL,19,Fhours following the incident.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
